      "message": "[error] Line 611: 🔴 In the `AUDIO_VIDEO` branch, `requestId` is used both as the promotion transaction ID and as the lookup key for `externalMediaHosts()-\u003ereadyHost({accountId, requestId})`. That couples two different identities and can make valid video-promotable calls fail whenever the client uses a fresh promotion request ID (which is the normal API pattern). Keep `requestId` for promotion signaling only, and resolve the conference/host via a distinct identifier (or derive it from call/conversation context) before calling `promoteExternalMedia`.",
